<title>BELGIUM: EMU delay could mean 20 year setback -- Lamassoure.</title>
<headline>EMU delay could mean 20 year setback -- Lamassoure.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Budget Minister Alain Lamassoure warned on Friday that a delay to Europe's single currency plans would risk putting the project back 20 years.</p>
<p>In an interview with the European Voice, Lamassoure said, &quot;If we say, 'why not have six months more, a year more, two years more?', then we might as well make it 20 years because</p>
</text>
